# React & UI

- Functional components only.
- Compose from `src/components/ui` primitives before inventing new base controls.
- Keep views thin; put orchestration in hooks/stores.
- Dark slate/zinc Mission Control look; avoid purple-gradient or generic AI aesthetics.
- One job per panel/section.
- Markdown rendering belongs in dedicated message components.
